            repository.updateTeamRosterState(raceId, teamId, TeamStatus.LOCKED, rosterVersion, now);
            recomputeLockedTeamStandings(raceId, raceVersion);
            return ServiceResult.created(new RosterLockResponse(raceId, teamId, rosterVersion, raceVersion, normalizedMembers, now, rosterKey));
        });
}
```

normalizeMembers: trim, filter? No — @NotBlank ensures non-blank. distinct + sorted:
```java
private static List<String> normalizeMembers(List<String> members) {
    return members.stream().map(String::trim).distinct().sorted().toList();
}
```
Note: dedupe means duplicates in request are normalized away — "规范化成员集合". Size check on normalized set.

